# What packagist ships. The pack, the CLI and the engine are the product; the
# rest is how this repository develops them. Before this file existed 56.8% of
# the tarball was dev-only — tests, docs, the repo's own lint and phpunit
# config — and every consumer received all of it.
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/tests export-ignore
/scripts export-ignore
/docs export-ignore
/phpunit.xml.dist export-ignore
/phpcs.xml.dist export-ignore
/phpstan.neon export-ignore
